<concept id="t00099">
	<title id="e00515">Hood </title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>hood</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>The hood serves as a cover for the engine room.</p>
		<p>Open the hood if maintenance work needs to be performed in the engine room or if you need to look at the compartment.</p>
	</conbody>
